 <h3><u>Bibi Zehra ki hai rukhsati</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p></p>
  <p>Ho mubarak tumhe ya nabi, bibi zehra ki hai rukhsati<br> doolha haider(a.s.) Bana zehra(s.a.) Dulhan bani<br> ho mubarak tumhay ya nabi(s.a.w.w)<br> aaj zahra(s.a) ki hai rukhsati<br> mubarak mubarak mubarak mubarak<br> <br> is kay chehray ka ghaza bani hai haya<br> is kay mathey ka jhoomar hai alhamd ka<br> innama iskay hathon ka kangan bana<br> dekhye tu guloo band hai kulkafa<br> <br> khalq may na mili aisi dulhan koi<br> ayaton say libase uroosi bana<br> nor chehray pay aya hai wal fajr ka<br> or kalai ka zevar bani hai hal ata<br> <br> goshwaray muzzamil kay hain ba khuda(j.j)<br> saj gayin fatima(s.a) parh kay nad-e-ali(a.s)<br> aaj dharti falak say siwa hogaye<br> yeh zameen ka muqaddar bhi dekhay koi<br> <br> sab yahan agaye khuld khali hui<br> aaj khair-un-nisa(s.a.) Aisi dulhan bani<br> aisa dulha bana aaj haq(j.j.) Ka wali(a.s.)<br> Aisa dulha kahan aisi dulhan kahan<br> <br> jin ki khushyun may shamil hain kon-0-makaa'n<br> jagmaganay lagi arsh per kehkashan<br> chand denay laga aaj khud hi azaan<br> muskara kar sada yeh sitaroo'n nay di<br> <br> momino kay liyay hai khushi ki khabar<br> gehma gehmi machi hai payamber(s.a.w.w) kay ghar<br> khush hain salmano miqdaro boozar udhar<br> shadmani hai chehron pay sub kay magar<br> jalnay walon kay dil per churi chal gay<br> <br> tehniyat ko chalay arsh say anmbyaa(a.s.)<br> Aur mohammad(s.a.w.w) kay dar per kia jhamghata<br> aakay jibraeel(a.s) nay arsh say yeh kaha<br> keh raha hai khuda(j.j) ay habib-e-khuda(s.a.w.w)<br> le kay baarat ko arahay hain ali(a.s)<br> <br> le kay barat sher-e-khuda aa gay&nbsp;<br> lenay apni dulhan (s.a) murtaza (a.s) aa gay&nbsp;<br> milne haider (a.s) say sub anbiya (a.s) aa gay&nbsp;<br> peshwai ko khud mustafa (s.a.w.w) aa gay&nbsp;<br> mara jibraeel(a.s),mara jibraeel(a.s) nar-e-haidery&nbsp;<br> ya aliiiiiiiiiiiiiiiiii (a.s)<br> <br> phir wo lamhe khushi kay qareeb aa gay&nbsp;<br> mustafa (s.a.w.w) sikgha-e-aqd parhnay lagay&nbsp;<br> khud ba khud lafz saray qasidaye banay&nbsp;<br> sub marhil bahusn o khushi tay howay&nbsp;<br> marzi-e-kibriya haq mehr ban gaiye<br> <br> gungunati fizah gungunati hawa<br> agay agay barat kay hain anbiya (a.s)<br> aur khadija (s.a) ne anchal ka saya kia&nbsp;<br> khum kay saghar chlaknay lagay jah bajah<br> beti (s.a) rukhsat howi ,ankh num ho gai<br> <br> kis qadr khus hain farhan o zill-e-raza<br> haq-e-midhat bhi yun ho raha hai adda<br> us (a.s) ki zojah (s.a) bani hai aaj khair-ul-nisa (s.a)<br> jis ko kehtay hain sub mazhr-e-kibriya&nbsp;<br> shor-e-sale allah mein howi rukhsati</p> 
